    <briefdescription>
<para>Link attribute mutation under churn scenario for process linker. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Input:</bold> Concurrent updates to same link metadata <linebreak/>
 <bold>Expected Behavior:</bold> Last-Write-Wins conflict resolution <linebreak/>
 <bold>Trigger:</bold> Implicit LWW; winner determined by version clock <linebreak/>
 <bold>Success Criteria:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>All updates resolve without deadlock</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Final state is consistent with one update (no merge)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Version numbers form total order</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Conflict count is deterministic given same timing </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
